  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Mialebouni Gari Capacity Building Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed project will enable Mialebouni to improve and expand their cassava processing capabilities by strengthening the groups production and organizational capacity. Production and product quality will be increased through training in improved production techniques and access to appropriate processing equipment and facilities to increase productivity, reduce the labor requirements, and improve safety and working conditions, as well as meet health and sanitation standards.</narrative>
  </description>
